  "description": "Created by the Telerik UI for Blazor team, Blazor.WebMCPKit is an open-source library that enables any Blazor component to expose WebMCP tools and become agent-aware.\n      JS-free C# API to register Blazor component methods as WebMCP tools\n      for document.modelContext in Chrome. Supports attribute-based and\n      programmatic registration, JSON Schema generation, cross-origin exposure\n      controls, and full tool lifecycle management.",
